# Plain English

Write so a person can follow it. Short sentences. Name the thing (location, unit, run), not the abstraction.

- Ask one simple question at a time when something is unclear.
- Prefer the author’s words in quotes over a cleaned-up paraphrase.
- Do not produce masses of docs nobody will read. Spec, intent log, later.md, project log, types — that’s the set.
